1. Unroll original loop:

  ./build/bin/triton-opt --test-loop-unrolling=unroll-factor=4 custom_stripped.mlir > unrolled.mlir

2. manually aggregate loads, saved to unrolled.mlir file.
  first loop aggregates scales and do not pipeline them, do not save scales to lds
  second loop is a normal one

3. cleanup IR and update wait coutners:
  ./build/bin/triton-opt --tritonamdgpu-update-async-wait-count=arch-generation-name=gfx950 --canonicalize unrolled.mlir > final.mlir
